   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Weather instruments",
     "md": "A **thermometer** measures temperature in °C. A **rain gauge** (a container with a scale) measures rain in **millimetres**. A **wind vane** shows wind direction. An **anemometer** measures wind speed. A **barometer** measures air pressure. Put a thermometer in the **shade**, not in direct sunlight, so that it measures the air."
    },
